  "changes": [
    {
      "zh": "新增界面卡死检测：主线程每 250ms 打心跳，独立看门狗线程超 5 秒收不到心跳就抓主线程栈写 hang.log（每 5 秒一次、最多 6 次），恢复时记下卡死时长。之前「界面卡住」这类问题一条记录都留不下——进程还活着，faulthandler 与异常钩子都不会触发",
      "en": "New UI hang detection: the main thread beats a heartbeat every 250 ms, and an independent watchdog thread dumps the main-thread stack into hang.log when the beat stops for 5 s (sampling every 5 s, at most 6 times), noting the total hang duration on recovery. Previously a frozen UI left no evidence at all, since the process is still alive and neither faulthandler nor the exception hooks fire"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增崩溃诊断一键上报：上次异常退出后重启会弹窗询问是否发送诊断报告，弹窗内可预览全文，并分别控制是否包含操作记录与请求地址；Authorization / Cookie 等敏感头与 token / password 等参数一律替换为「已脱敏」。也可以从帮助菜单「发送崩溃诊断报告…」随时手动补发",
      "en": "New one-click crash report: after an abnormal exit, the next launch asks whether to send a diagnostic report, with a full preview and separate toggles for the action log and request URLs. Sensitive headers (Authorization, Cookie) and secret-looking parameters (token, password) are always replaced with a redaction marker. The report can also be sent at any time from Help > Send crash diagnostics..."
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复详情对话框关闭后不释放、每次双击泄漏约 56MB 的问题；同时修复关窗后流式渲染定时器仍在后台继续往已隐藏的编辑器里追加内容，导致界面持续卡顿",
      "en": "Fixed the flow detail dialog never being freed after closing (about 56 MB leaked per double-click), and the streaming render timer continuing to append into the hidden editor after the window closed, which kept the UI busy"
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复 3.0.0 中「页签拖出浮窗」实际不可用的问题（底层模块已入库但未接入界面）。现在按住左侧导航按钮往外拖即可把该页拖成独立窗口；工具页五个子页（编码转换 / JSON / 比对 / API 调试 / FIX）也能各自拖出；详情面板的「请求」「响应」页可单独浮出，详情面板整体可从菜单「工具 → 拖出详情面板…」或页签右键拖出，收回时按原分隔比例还原",
      "en": "Fixed 3.0.0's detached-panel feature being unusable in practice (the module shipped but was never wired into the UI). Drag a nav rail button outward to pop that page into its own window; the five tool sub-tabs (codec / JSON / compare / API / FIX) each detach too; the detail panel's Request and Response tabs float independently, and the whole panel detaches from Tools > Detach detail panel... or the tab context menu, restoring the original split ratio on reattach"
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复浮窗场景下弹窗锁死整个应用：确认框与文件选择框改为窗口模态（只锁发起它的窗口），请求集合对话框改为真非模态并复用同一实例",
      "en": "Fixed dialogs freezing the whole app while a float window is open: message boxes and file dialogs are now window-modal (blocking only their own window), and the API collections dialog is truly modeless and reuses one instance"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增 FIX 协议解析工具页（Ctrl+Shift+F）：粘贴报文自动解析成树形表格，字段名与枚举释义、重复组可折叠，自带 BodyLength/CheckSum 校验，多条消息按 tab 分列、错误标红；支持导入各合作方的私有字段字典（协议说明整理成 CSV/JSON，PDF/Word 表格贴进 Excel 另存 CSV 也认），私有 tag 自动显示成业务字段名与枚举释义",
      "en": "New FIX parser tool page (Ctrl+Shift+F): paste raw FIX and get a tree table with field names, enum explanations and collapsible repeat groups, built-in BodyLength/CheckSum validation, and one tab per message with failures flagged in red. Partner dictionaries are supported too: import a private-field spec as CSV/JSON (a table copied from PDF/Word into Excel and saved as CSV works), and private tags are decoded into business field names and enum meanings"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增域名过滤页：黑名单与白名单两个独立列表 + 启用开关（三态），流量列表右键即可把域名加入名单，写 example.com 同时覆盖其子域",
      "en": "New domain filter page: separate blacklist and whitelist with a three-state switch, add a host from the traffic table's context menu, and example.com also covers its subdomains"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增 API 集合：把当前请求保存到本地，支持加载、重命名、删除，常用请求一键复用",
      "en": "New API collections: save the current request locally with load, rename and delete, so frequent requests are one click away"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增 TLS 页签：协议版本、加密套件、SNI、ALPN 与证书链一目了然，仅对 TLS 流量显示",
      "en": "New TLS tab: protocol version, cipher suite, SNI, ALPN and certificate chain at a glance, shown only for TLS flows"
    },
    {
      "zh": "API 面板支持 GraphQL：自动识别请求体，query 与 variables 分区编辑",
      "en": "GraphQL support in the API panel: request bodies are detected automatically, with query and variables edited separately"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增命令面板（Ctrl/Cmd+K）与流量表状态码 minimap：命令即输即搜、回车执行，色点窄带快速定位异常请求",
      "en": "New command palette (Ctrl/Cmd+K) and status-code minimap: type to filter commands and press Enter to run, and spot failing requests from a colored dot strip"
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复已知 Bug：FIX 多条消息被并成一条（逐行复制带时间戳前缀、上一条末尾分隔符丢失时切不开）、字典导入对文档里复制出来的表格识别不全、证书服务按钮点击无响应、代理线程异常退出后界面未复位、隧道连接流量缓存泄漏、MCP 写操作跨线程、启动端口被占用未提示、关闭应用误报「意外退出」、IPv6 地址显示错误等",
      "en": "Fixed known bugs: multiple FIX messages collapsing into one (per-line logs with timestamp prefixes, or a missing trailing separator), tables copied out of documents not being fully recognized on dictionary import, plus unresponsive certificate-service button, UI not resetting after the proxy thread died, flow-cache leaks on tunnel connections, cross-thread MCP writes, silent port fallback on startup, false 'proxy exited' warning on quit, wrong IPv6 URLs and more"
    },
    {
      "zh": "体验优化：全局控件质感、流量表数值列等宽右对齐、脚本编辑器 Python 语法高亮、JSON 树三列并按层展开、左侧图标导航栏（可钉住、Ctrl+1–9）、请求概览卡、行密度切换与空态引导；FIX 字段树标签列按内容自适应并补全悬浮提示（5 位私有 tag 不再截断），同名字典重复导入直接覆盖更新",
      "en": "Experience polish: overall control styling, right-aligned monospaced numeric columns, Python syntax highlighting in the script editor, a three-column JSON tree with expand-by-depth, an icon nav rail (pinnable, Ctrl+1–9), a request overview card, row-density switching and empty-state guidance; the FIX tag column now sizes to its content with full tooltips (5-digit private tags are no longer truncated), and re-importing a dictionary with the same name overwrites it instead of creating a duplicate"
    }
  ]
}
